00:00:18.840 --> 00:00:19.840
Oh thanks.

00:00:19.840 --> 00:00:20.910
It's good to be with you.

00:00:20.910 --> 00:00:26.800
So maybe to start with you to get our audience
into sort of your framing and sort of point

00:00:26.800 --> 00:00:28.420
of view on a lot of this stuff.

00:00:28.420 --> 00:00:35.370
You've said that technology and markets often
